ldren":"The borrowing question is the second. Rajkot units invest heavily in CNC machines, furnaces and presses, often on credit, and a founder taking on substantial machinery debt has a real reason to want liability capped and the business separated from personal assets. That is a legitimate reason to incorporate, quite apart from any customer requirement."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"href":"#enquiry","className":"brand-gradient inline-flex min-h-[3.25rem] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-7 font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-soft","children":["Talk to an Expert",["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/services/pvt-registration/","className":"inline-flex min-h-[3.25rem] items-center justify-center rounded-xl border-2 border-primary px-7 font-semibold text-primary transition-colors hover:bg-primary hover:text-primary-foreground","children":["Full ","Private Limited"," guide"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground","children":"At a glance"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-sm","children":[["$","div","Structure",{"className":"border-l-2 border-primary/30 pl-4","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-secondary","children":"Structure"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Private Limited"}]]}],"$L38","$L39","$L3a","$L3b"]}],"$L3c"]}]]}]}]}]
